# M26: an installed package is a Mix dependency. hello_app's closure installs
# hello_dep first (M15), the build that follows resolves it where it is -
# /priv/apps/hello_dep - on a box with no network, and the module that ends up
# loaded is that one copy (M10: one version per package).
# Keys match at the start of a line, in order (demos/check.sh).
%{}
{:ok, :hello_app}
[:hello_app, :hello_dep]
[dest: "/priv/apps/hello_dep", requirement: "~> 0.1"]
"0.1.0"
{:hello_app, :from_hello_dep}
"/priv/apps/hello_dep/ebin/
elixos-shim: shutdown poweroff
